  unitName: "Deemo and the Girl (4\u2605)"
  unitId: 50563
  unitNumber: 641
  description: Deemo, the mysterious inhabitant of an otherworldly castle and the
    girl who suddenly fell from the sky. Deemo, who wished to return the girl he'd
    saved who had fallen from above to the world from which she came, found strange
    trees growing to the sound of his piano. Then one day, an unfamiliar window suddenly
    appeared before them. On the other side lied "Grand Gaia," a world unknown to
    the two of them.
  summonDesc: Where am I?<br>This is Grand Gaia, you say?<br>It seems strange to
    me.
  fusionDesc: Our strength has increased.<br>This feels quite strange.<br>It's like
    the music Deemo plays.
